  <!-- Join Requirements -->

  <!-- EN: At least {0} injured folk in the settlement. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_Injured_DescShort>殖民地裡至少要有{0}名傷患。</RK_JoinReq_Injured_DescShort>
  <!-- EN: Are there any here in need of a healing hand? -->
  <RK_JoinReq_Priest_Injured_Desc1>“這裡有人需要幫忙救治嗎？”</RK_JoinReq_Priest_Injured_Desc1>
  <!-- EN: With faith, even hardship may yet be overcome. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_Priest_Injured_Desc2>“只要信念堅定，再大的困難也能克服。”</RK_JoinReq_Priest_Injured_Desc2>
  <!-- EN: At least {0} medicine in store. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_Medicine_DescShort>殖民地裡至少要有{0}份醫藥庫存。</RK_JoinReq_Medicine_DescShort>
  <!-- EN: It would ease my heart to see ample remedies here. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_Priest_Medicine_Desc1>“如果這裡醫藥充足，我就能放心住下來了。”</RK_JoinReq_Priest_Medicine_Desc1>
  <!-- EN: With enough medicine, I could tend to many more souls... -->
  <RK_JoinReq_Priest_Medicine_Desc2>“只要醫藥充足，我就能救治更多人了...”</RK_JoinReq_Priest_Medicine_Desc2>
  <!-- EN: Settlement wealth must be at least {0}. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_StableLife_DescShort>殖民地的財富值至少要達到{0}。</RK_JoinReq_StableLife_DescShort>
  <!-- EN: I long to dwell in a proper village. The wanderer's road is too cruel. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_StableLife_Desc1>“我很想找個像樣的村鎮住下來，四處漂泊的生活還是太殘酷了。”</RK_JoinReq_StableLife_Desc1>
  <!-- EN: I seek a steadier village life. Small hamlets ask too much of a soul. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_StableLife_Desc2>“我想要過上更安穩的日子。那種破舊的小村鎮實在是待不下去。”</RK_JoinReq_StableLife_Desc2>
  <!-- EN: Settlement wealth must be at least {0}. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_NewLife_DescShort>殖民地的財富值至少要達到{0}。</RK_JoinReq_NewLife_DescShort>
  <!-- EN: With means such as these, perhaps I could begin anew. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_NewLife_Desc1>“有了這樣的條件兜底，也許我還能東山再起。”</RK_JoinReq_NewLife_Desc1>
  <!-- EN: I have had my fill of a poor life. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_NewLife_Desc2>“我已經過夠窮日子了。”</RK_JoinReq_NewLife_Desc2>
  <!-- EN: No settlers with these backgrounds: {0} -->
  <RK_JoinReq_NobleTired_DescShort>不能有具備以下背景故事的殖民者：\n{0}</RK_JoinReq_NobleTired_DescShort>
  <!-- EN: I am weary of bowing and scraping before the highborn. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_NobleTired_Desc1>“我受夠了在那些權貴面前低三下四。”</RK_JoinReq_NobleTired_Desc1>
  <!-- EN: I want no more dealings with nobles. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_NobleTired_Desc2>“我可不想再和那些貴族打交道了。”</RK_JoinReq_NobleTired_Desc2>
  <!-- EN: Highest Empire title among settlers must be {0} or lower. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_ServantRoyalTitle_DescShort>不能有榮譽頭銜高於{0}的殖民者。</RK_JoinReq_ServantRoyalTitle_DescShort>
  <!-- EN: I am weary of currying favor with the highborn. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_ServantRoyalTitle_Desc1>“鬼才想去討好那些權貴。”</RK_JoinReq_ServantRoyalTitle_Desc1>
  <!-- EN: If I must serve, I shall choose my own master. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_ServantRoyalTitle_Desc2>“如果非要給別人當手下，那我要自己去選值得追隨的老大。”</RK_JoinReq_ServantRoyalTitle_Desc2>
  <!-- EN:  or  -->
  <RK_JoinReq_ItemSeparatorOr>或</RK_JoinReq_ItemSeparatorOr>
  <!-- EN: Required: {0} -->
  <RK_JoinReq_WindFreedom_DescShort>需要：{0}</RK_JoinReq_WindFreedom_DescShort>
  <!-- EN: Life on the road has its charms, yet a spell of rest does too. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_WindFreedom_Desc1>“四處漂泊自有其魅力，但偶爾找個地方歇歇腳也不錯。”</RK_JoinReq_WindFreedom_Desc1>
  <!-- EN: Even a wanderer has tastes. I would need gear worth using. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_WindFreedom_Desc2>“怎麽？身為漂泊者的我當然也有自己的講究。我需要些值得一用的裝備。”</RK_JoinReq_WindFreedom_Desc2>
  <!-- EN: Need a settler with all of these skills: {0} -->
  <RK_JoinReq_SeekingMentor_DescShort>需要一名具備以下所有技能的殖民者：\n{0}</RK_JoinReq_SeekingMentor_DescShort>
  <!-- EN: I heed only one stronger than myself. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_SeekingMentor_Desc1>“只有比我更厲害的人才能命令我。”</RK_JoinReq_SeekingMentor_Desc1>
  <!-- EN: I seek a true warrior. Is there one among you? -->
  <RK_JoinReq_SeekingMentor_Desc2>“我在尋找一位真正的戰士。你們之中有這樣的人嗎？”</RK_JoinReq_SeekingMentor_Desc2>
  <!-- EN: Need a settler with at least one of these skills: {0} -->
  <RK_JoinReq_Prepared_DescShort>需要一名具備以下任意技能的殖民者：\n{0}</RK_JoinReq_Prepared_DescShort>
  <!-- EN: I am tired of surviving by my wits alone. I seek a proper mentor. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_Prepared_Desc1>“我厭倦只靠耍小聰明活下去了。我在尋找一位正經的師傅。”</RK_JoinReq_Prepared_Desc1>
  <!-- EN: Be it battle or craft, someone here must truly know their trade. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_Prepared_Desc2>“不管是打架還是做東西，這裡總該有真正的行家吧？”</RK_JoinReq_Prepared_Desc2>
  <!-- EN: No special requirements. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_JoinHope_DescShort>沒有特殊需求。</RK_JoinReq_JoinHope_DescShort>
  <!-- EN: A pleasure to meet you. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_JoinHope_Desc1>“很高興見到你。”</RK_JoinReq_JoinHope_Desc1>
  <!-- EN: I hope we shall get along well. -->
  <RK_JoinReq_JoinHope_Desc2>“希望我們能相處愉快。”</RK_JoinReq_JoinHope_Desc2>

